sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Her
  participant App as App (phone)
  participant Lib as Library
  participant Dev as device storage
  participant Acc as Access
  participant LC as library (Convex)
  Her->>App: capo +1 on a Song
  App->>Lib: update(songId, { capo })
  alt signed out (slice 1)
    Lib->>Dev: write entry, updatedAt now
  else signed in (login slice)
    Lib->>LC: save(entry)
    LC->>Acc: requireInvited(ctx)
    Acc-->>LC: userId
    LC->>LC: upsert by user and Song, newer updatedAt wins
  end
  Note over Lib,LC: first sign-in only
  Lib->>LC: importDevice(all device entries)
  LC->>LC: merge each by updatedAt, once per user
  LC-->>Lib: done
  Lib->>Dev: mark imported
